{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ajkkLY3Wyy1795473959.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞馬遜據報將斥資75億美元，收購AI人工智能初創公司Decart的大部分資產。</p><p></p><p>《彭博》報道，亞馬遜將取得Decart的AI基礎設施技術，能讓AI模型在現有常用硬件上，運行得更快、更省電，並會獲得Decart的創始團隊及公司的AI研究人員和工程師。</p><p></p><p>Decart由3名以色列工程師於2023年創立，去年開始與亞馬遜合作。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T23:42:58.064763+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T22:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T12:37:13.510700+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T23:36:14.682999+00:00","content_hash":"3014c4a64e24ee636b9ed3347720eaa120002ea2556b54dbf31f88177330df7f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T23:42:58.064763+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}